{"id":"escuela","lemma":"escuela","pos":"noun","rank":328,"glosses":["school (an institution dedicated to teaching and learning)","school (the followers of a particular doctrine)","crag"],"ipa":"/esˈkwela/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"escuelas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-escuela.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Te gusta la escuela?","en":"Do you like school?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/104596","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿Cuántas escuelas hay en vuestra ciudad?","en":"How many schools are there in your city?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/688888","words":[{"g":"how many"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"yours","l":"vuestro"},{"g":"city"}]},{"text":"Tú vas a la escuela, ¿cierto?","en":"You go to school, right?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599105","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"a certain, a specific"}]},{"text":"Yo solía ir a la escuela.","en":"I used to go to school.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458664","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be accustomed to…","l":"soler"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Yo voy a la escuela con él.","en":"I go to school with him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458592","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"he"}]}]}